* Range

The ⟪GTI18N_73fc46a2_000001⟫range⟪GTI18N_73fc46a2_000002⟫ form of the ⟪GTI18N_73fc46a2_000003⟫for⟪GTI18N_73fc46a2_000004⟫ loop iterates over a slice or map.

When ranging over a slice, two values are returned for each iteration.
The first is the index, and the second is a copy of the element at that index.

